@UserManagementAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5148
@token = replace-with-valid-jwt-from-your-identity-provider

### Get all users
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a user by ID
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a user
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Ana García",
  "email": "ana.garcia@techhive.example",
  "department": "Human Resources"
}

### Update a user
PUT {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Ana García",
  "email": "ana.garcia@techhive.example",
  "department": "Information Technology"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### API request without a token (401)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/problem+json

### Get a user that does not exist (404)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/999999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a user with invalid fields (400)
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "   ",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "department": "Human Resources"
}

### OpenAPI document (available in Development)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
